bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_space_hang_before_moving_empty_inline_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 w5-5: fixed in layout_engine.spl via line_hang_from tracking and preserving line_end_hang across moving empty inlines so align_inline_line_horizontal shifts nodes from line_hang_from onward back by -line_end_hang; added AC-23 in inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec.spl and discriminating Bug 4 checks (preceding inline-block path:0/0 x=285/289, path:0/1 x=295/299, path:0/2 x=399, and trailing-space vs no-space parity) in layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec.spl. Windows host interpreter: layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec 5/5 passed; AC-23 passes in inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec (9/24 total)."
    web_render_space_hang_before_moving_empty_inline_2026-11-27, 1, "close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec.spl"

