    web_render_space_hang_before_moving_empty_inline_2026-11-27, fixing, p3sweep-20261127, 2026-11-27T12:03:09Z, 2026-11-27T12:03:09Z, open, "wave3"

    web_render_space_hang_before_moving_empty_inline_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: reproduced both cases on HEAD: margin-only empty inline Simple 291 vs Chrome 295, border-only 295 vs 299 - the trailing space never hung. Root cause: layout_engine.spl inline child loop reset the line_end_hang accumulator to 0 whenever an empty inline element that moves the pen closed the line. Fix: deleted that reset branch (two hunks incl. now-unused empty_plain_inline to avoid unused-vars lint); margin/border still counts into the pen, the space hangs, matching Chrome 159. Strict A/B vs true baseline: probe 0/2 to 2/2 PASS (295/299); main spec only AC-23 flips to green (10 passed post-fix = 9 pre-existing + AC-23), every other AC byte-identical; 8 neighbouring whitespace/line-breaking specs identical verdicts; warning sets identical (no new warnings). The spec's 13 remaining failures are pre-existing host font-metric drift, unchanged. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/empty_inline_line_box_chrome159_spec.spl"
